    %% Browser connections
    HTML -->|fetch()| SpringBoot
    JS -->|fetch()| SpringBoot
    CSS -.-> HTML

    %% Controller to Service
    Controllers --> Services
    Controllers --> Strategy
    Controllers --> Cache

    %% Service to Calculator
    Services --> Calculators
    Services --> Strategy
    Services --> Repositories
    Services --> External
    Services --> Cache

    %% Strategy Engine flow
    MultiEngine --> Aggregator
    MultiEngine --> ConditionSvc
    MultiEngine --> IndicatorRepo
    MultiEngine --> PriceRepo
    Aggregator --> ConfigSvc

    %% Calculators to Repositories (for persistence)
    Calculators -.->|persisted via| IndicatorRepo
    TechAnalysisSvc --> Calculators

    %% Schedulers trigger Services
    Schedulers --> Services
    Schedulers --> Repositories

    %% Repositories to Database
    Repositories --> Database
    Stocks --> Prices
    Stocks --> Indicators
    Stocks --> RSIValues
    Stocks --> SRLevels
    Stocks --> Snapshots
    Portfolios --> Holdings
    Watchlists -.-> Stocks

    %% External API integrations
    YahooSvc --> Yahoo
    DhanSvc --> Dhan
    FiiDiiSvc --> NSE
    BulkDealRepo -.-> NSEBulk
    BlockDealRepo -.-> NSEBulk
    InstitutionalSvc -.-> NSEXBRL

    %% Cache connections
    Services -.-> Cache

